考えております。今後とも、酪農家が安心して生乳生産に取り組めるように、生乳需給の状況を注視しながら、必要な対策をし…", "…えております。今後とも、酪農家が安心して生乳生産に取り組めるように、生乳需給の状況を注視しながら、必要な対策をしっかり検討してまいりたいと考…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/21", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/23", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/25", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/27", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/29", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/31", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/33", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/35", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/37", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/75", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/77", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/79", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/83", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/85", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/87", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/89", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/91", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/95", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/97", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/99", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/107", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X00820201208/113", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120305007X0082020